    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it’s not really evolving. it just feels like being erased. if a house is totally dark and empty, there's nothing left for anyone to see or care about. it’s just better to just... turn the lights off for good before it gets even darker. it would be so much quieter that way.",
